@page "/"

<PageTitle>Trove</PageTitle>

<h1>Home</h1>
<p class="trove-lead">What you're in the middle of and what's up next, across books, video, movies and TV, games and articles.</p>

<section class="trove-grid">
    <div class="trove-card">
        <h2>In progress</h2>
        <p class="trove-empty">Nothing in progress yet. Items you start will show here with their progress.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="trove-card">
        <h2>Up next</h2>
        <p class="trove-empty">Your up next list is empty. Move things here from your wishlist or library.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="trove-card">
        <h2>This year's goals</h2>
        <p class="trove-empty">No goals set for @DateTime.Today.Year yet. <a href="goals">Set one in Goals</a>.</p>
    </div>
</section>
